    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The NuGet Server API is a set of HTTP endpoints used to download packages, fetch metadata, publish new packages, and perform other operations against a NuGet package source. The V3 API uses JSON as its underlying media type and is accessed through a service index located at https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json, which enumerates all available resources and capabilities. This specification covers the service index and package publish endpoints.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: NuGet Support",
